      "content": "the news or surveys seem too slow for what i'm doing. it's more subtle than that. i'm not just helping people feel better, i'm preventing things from cascading. like, if i hadn't stepped in at that bank, that teller's stress might have triggered a chain reaction in the lobby, maybe a confrontation that gets recorded, goes viral, and starts some kind of local panic or market volatility. i need a way to see the \"shadow\" of what almost happened. is there a way to model these potential fallout paths so i can be more precise with my next move?",
